<title>SOUTH AFRICA: New Wits lifts interim shr, div held.</title>
<headline>New Wits lifts interim shr, div held.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	  36	 vs 23</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		    17	 vs 17</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			11.08    vs 7.03</p>
<p>    Tax			    nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Interest paid		nil	vs 0.09</p>
<p>    Revenue			13.17    vs 8.92</p>
<p>    Expenditure		  2.09     vs 1.92</p>
<p>Div payable February 26</p>
<p>on register February 7</p>
<p>Full name: New Wits Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE: Directors said if the gold price remained at its present depressed level, earnings in the second half of the year were expected to be lower.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
